{"id":"n65302-3-8","stage":2,"title":"시절 · 季节","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n65302-3-8-1","ko":"날씨가 벌써 추워지네.","zh":"天气已经变冷了呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"날씨가","meaning":"天气","explanation":"날씨：天气；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"날씨","audio":"/audio/fe655cf1d979cf3db76c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60630","senseId":"1","lemma":"날씨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"날씨가","audio":"/audio/7f36def9da34b4ea3404.mp3"}},{"text":"벌써","meaning":"已经","explanation":"벌써：已经","readings":[{"term":"벌써","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58977","senseId":"1","lemma":"벌써","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"벌써","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3"}},{"text":"추워지네.","meaning":"冷；表示成为前面表达的状态。","explanation":"춥다：冷；지다：表示成为前面表达的状态。；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"춥다","audio":"/audio/7c651efb56d12a6540a4.mp3"},{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72146","senseId":"2","lemma":"춥다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77247","senseId":"3","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"추워지네","audio":"/audio/82458a64b26679fc706e.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"fe655cf1d979cf3d","term":"날씨","zh":"天气","audio":"/audio/fe655cf1d979cf3db76c.mp3","entryId":"60630","definition":"每天在气温或空气中出现的，如雨、云、风、雾等的状况。","pronunciation":["날씨"]},{"id":"d038c1cb7ee215cb","term":"벌써","zh":"已经","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3","entryId":"58977","definition":"比想象早地。","pronunciation":["벌써"]},{"id":"7c651efb56d12a65","term":"춥다","zh":"冷","audio":"/audio/7c651efb56d12a6540a4.mp3","entryId":"72146","definition":"大气温度低。","pronunciation":["춥따"]},{"id":"6fde84679c7f2c31","term":"지다","zh":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3","entryId":"77247","definition":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","pronunciation":["지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/9e1db49c845054a23828.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n65302-3-8-2","ko":"그러게. 놀러 다니기 좋은 시절은 다 지나갔다.","zh":"是啊，适合出去玩的美好时光早就过去了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그러게.","meaning":"就是嘛，可不嘛","explanation":"그러게：就是嘛，可不嘛","readings":[{"term":"그러게","audio":"/audio/87d7b69edce28452d447.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36269","senseId":"1","lemma":"그러게","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그러게","audio":"/audio/87d7b69edce28452d447.mp3"}},{"text":"놀러","meaning":"游荡，晃悠","explanation":"놀다：游荡，晃悠；러：用于移动动词前，表示移动的目的：“去/来做……”。","readings":[{"term":"놀다","audio":"/audio/8fc8305f6371680eeeca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88353","senseId":"7","lemma":"놀다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"놀러","audio":"/audio/56ad7f4b97efb1434426.mp3"}},{"text":"다니기","meaning":"来往，走遍，","explanation":"다니다：来往，走遍，；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达。","readings":[{"term":"다니다","audio":"/audio/02309ed22c9c36273e57.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29702","senseId":"4","lemma":"다니다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다니기","audio":"/audio/959140b52b97a87bbeb1.mp3"}},{"text":"좋은","meaning":"好，吉","explanation":"좋다：好，吉；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"9","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋은","audio":"/audio/dc3caaaf06a600dc6306.mp3"}},{"text":"시절은","meaning":"季节，时节","explanation":"시절：季节，时节；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"시절","audio":"/audio/4ccb6cf5cb86b6f8cebe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65302","senseId":"3","lemma":"시절","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시절은","audio":"/audio/3f0054df7cd66204ad40.mp3"}},{"text":"다","meaning":"快，就要","explanation":"다：快，就要","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58176","senseId":"2","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}},{"text":"지나갔다.","meaning":"经过，度过","explanation":"지나가다：经过，度过；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"지나가다","audio":"/audio/9c25392f9bf0bb82799e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60216","senseId":"3","lemma":"지나가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지나갔다","audio":"/audio/7541e02264ddc0cdf1b6.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"87d7b69edce28452","term":"그러게","zh":"就是嘛，可不嘛","audio":"/audio/87d7b69edce28452d447.mp3","entryId":"36269","definition":"用于赞成或同意对方所说的话。","pronunciation":["그러게"]},{"id":"8fc8305f6371680e","term":"놀다","zh":"游荡，晃悠","audio":"/audio/8fc8305f6371680eeeca.mp3","entryId":"88353","definition":"到处转悠。","pronunciation":["놀ː다"]},{"id":"02309ed22c9c3627","term":"다니다","zh":"来往，走遍，","audio":"/audio/02309ed22c9c36273e57.mp3","entryId":"29702","definition":"到处走动。","pronunciation":["다니다"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，吉","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"日子或机会等正合适。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]},{"id":"4ccb6cf5cb86b6f8","term":"시절","zh":"季节，时节","audio":"/audio/4ccb6cf5cb86b6f8cebe.mp3","entryId":"65302","definition":"把一年按照气候变化分成一定的时期。","pronunciation":["시절"]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"快，就要","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58176","definition":"动作或状态的程度似乎接近限定程度地。","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"9c25392f9bf0bb82","term":"지나가다","zh":"经过，度过","audio":"/audio/9c25392f9bf0bb82799e.mp3","entryId":"60216","definition":"随着时间流逝，某个时期结束。","pronunciation":["지나가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/d3353d645a1f2008aa52.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.575,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=65302","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"3","sourceLevel":"중급","day":73,"sequenceScore":2.0257,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["是啊，适合出去玩的美好时光早就过去了。","天气已经变冷了呢。","是什么味道啊？"]